{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1e72f2403f78a197","name":"Eyes of the Force","source":{"id":"source:reference-1e72f2403f78a197","title":"Eyes of the Force","revision":20412,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:47:45Z","sha256":"e9a66b4f3596087f876f551b9e1ca6c09c1c39974c31faeb7ea175b18a406fd1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20412","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Eyes%20of%20the%20Force&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1e72f2403f78a197","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This Training Regimen trains you to sense images that you cannot normally see by reading the surface thoughts of others. During this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Regimen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Regimen"},", an assistant holds a two-dimensional image viewer so that you can't see the images being displayed on the screen. As the image viewer cycles through different images of common objects, you must read the surface thoughts of the assistant to determine what image is being displayed on the screen at that time.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," 1 Hour\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," Self\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Requirements:"]}," A two-dimensional image display and an assistant.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You successfully read one-third of the assistant's surface thoughts. You gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telepathy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telepathy"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["18\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You successfully read two-thirds of the assistant's surface thoughts. You gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telepathy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telepathy"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["23\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You successfully read all of the assistant's surface thoughts. You gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telepathy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telepathy"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill. In addition, if you successfully use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telepathy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telepathy"}," against an unwilling target, you can also sense the target's surface emotions and stray thoughts (as determined by the Gamemaster).\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
